 clipped at the edge of each tile. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClipsCoordinates","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionsimplificationtolerance","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a double; specifies the Douglas-Peucker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simplification tolerance. A greater value produces simpler geometries and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improves performance. The default value is 0.375."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionbuffer","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"text":" object containing an integer; specifies the size of the tile","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"buffer on each side. A value of 0 produces no buffer. A value of 512 produces a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"buffer as wide as the tile itself. Larger values produce fewer rendering","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"artifacts near tile edges and slower performance. The default value is 128.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionwrapscoordinates","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a Boolean value; specifies whether the shape of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" should be wrapped to accomodate coordinates with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"longitudes beyond −180 and 180. The default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionWrapsCoordinates","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource\/initwithidentifier:datasource:options:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a custom shape data source initialized with an identifier, data source, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary of options for the source according to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","title":"initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:dataSource:options:","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource","title":"MLNComputedShapeSource","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one tile at a time, to be shown on the map on demand. You implement a class"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforming to the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that returns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", then add a computed shape source to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the computed shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNComputedShapeSource"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionminimumzoomlevel","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the minimum zoom level at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. The default value is 0."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"title":"MLNShape","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesourcedatasource","title":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Data source for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":". This protocol defines two optional methods for fetching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, one based on tile coordinates, and one based on a bounding box. Classes that implement this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol must implement one, and only one of the methods. Methods on this protocol will not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called on main thread, they will be called on the caller’s "},{"code":"requestQueue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","kind":"symbol"}}}